Hi Gateau La Viennoise (Bd Léger),

Your juin tax invoice is now available to download in the [Merchant Portal](http://www.doordash.com/merchant/financials/tax-invoices?store_id=28114454).

The tax invoice is based on your monthly DoorDash commissions and
fees. You do not need to make a separate payment to settle this
tax invoice because DoorDash will withhold the fees and tax from
your regular payout.
[Download now](http://www.doordash.com/merchant/financials/tax-invoices?store_id=28114454)

*Please note, DoorDash cannot provide tax advice. If you have any
questions about your own taxes, please consult a tax
professional.

For more information, please [contact support](https://help.doordash.com/merchants/s/?language=en_US).
